    rdfs:label "The 2016 Cactus Bowl was a post-season American college football bowl game played on 2016 at Chase Field in Phoenix, Arizona. It was one of the 2015–16 bowl games that concluded the 2015 FBS football season and was the final bowl game prior to the 2016 College Football Playoff National Championship game. The 2016 Cactus Bowl marked the game's return to Chase Field, its home from 2000 until 2005, after a ten-year absence during which the game was played at Sun Devil Stadium in Tempe, Arizona." .

