ns1:51205 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The El Castillo del Terror (Spanish for \"The Tower of Terror\") was a major lucha libre event produced and scripted by the Mexican International Wrestling Revolution Group (IWRG) professional wrestling promotion on 2008. The El Castillo del Terror show was the ninth ever IWRG El Castillo del Terror event held and the second held in 2008, less than two months after the first 2008 El Castillo del Terror show. At the first El Castillo del Terror show in 2008, held on November 2, Arlequín was the last man in the cage as Máscara Año 2000 Jr. climbed out." .

