ns1:52161 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Sacrifice was a professional wrestling pay-per-view (PPV) event produced by Total Nonstop Action Wrestling (TNA) promotion, which took place on 2011 at the Impact Wrestling Zone in Orlando. It was the seventh Sacrifice event. Sacrifice featured nine professional wrestling matches that involved different wrestlers from pre-existing scripted feuds and storylines." .

ns1:5217 ns1:appears_in ns1:43539 .

ns1:52177 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Sin Piedad (Spanish for \"No Mercy\") was an annual professional wrestling major event produced by Consejo Mundial de Lucha Libre (CMLL), which took place on December 14, 2012 in Arena México, Mexico City and replaced CMLL's regular Friday night show Super Viernes (\"Super Friday\"). The 2012 Sin Piedad was the eleventh event under that name that CMLL has promoted their last major show of the year, always held in December. All Sin Piedad shows have been held in Arena México in Mexico City which is CMLL's main venue, its \"home\". The event featured six professional wrestling matches with different wrestlers involved in pre-existing scripted feuds, plots and storylines. Tonga came to Mexico in October for a \"learning excursion\", during which Tonga and La Sombra has been on opposite sides in several matches, although they had not met in a one-on-one match before their Sin Piedad main event match." .

