    rdfs:label "The 2018 World Weightlifting Championships – men's 109 kg competition at the 2018 World Weightlifting Championships was held on 2018–2018." .

ns1:41348 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The League of Ireland Cup (Irish: Corn Sraithe na hÉireann) is a association football competition open to all League of Ireland clubs. Some invited clubs from the lower levels of the Republic of Ireland association football league system participate and occasionally these sides have included junior league representative selections. The competition began in 1973, replacing the earlier League of Ireland Shield." .

ns1:41349 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The opening ceremony for the 2018 Commonwealth Games took place on the evening of Wednesday 04 April 2018 in the Carrara Stadium, Gold Coast." .

