    rdfs:label "2012–13 Belarusian Cup was the twenty second season of the Belarus annual cup competition." .

ns1:41358 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1994–95 Welsh Alliance League was the eleventh season of the Welsh Alliance League after its establishment in 1984." .

ns1:41360 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1923–24 Loyola Ramblers men's basketball team represents Loyola University Chicago during the 1923–24 NCAA men's basketball season." .

ns1:41365 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2004 Monmouthshire County Council election were held on 2004 to Monmouthshire County Council in southeast Wales, on the same day of the European Elections." .

ns1:41366 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Suriname competed at the Suriname at the 2011 World Championships in Athletics from August 27 to September 4 in Daegu, South Korea." .

