    rdfs:label "Japan at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics participated at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics in Buenos Aires, Argentina from 6 October to 2018. Japan at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics qualified two dancers based on its performance at the 2018 World Youth Breaking Championship. Japan at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics qualified three athletes based on its performance at the 2018 Cadet World Championship. Japan at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics qualified two gymnasts based on its performance at the 2018 Asian Junior Championship. Japan at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics qualified one gymnast based on its performance at the 2018 Asian Junior Championship. Japan at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics qualified two gymnasts based on its performance at the 2018 Asian Junior Championship. Japan at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics qualified three athlete based on the rankings in the Buenos Aires 2018 Olympic Standings. Japan at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics qualified one boat based on its performance at the 2018 Asian Youth Olympic Games Qualification Regatta. Japan at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics qualified one boat based on its performance at the 2018 Singapore Open (Asian Techno 293+ Qualifiers). Japan at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics qualified two athletes based on its performance at the 2018 Asian Youth Olympic Games Qualifier. Japan at the 2018 Summer Youth Olympics qualified one athlete based on its performance at the 2018 Asian Youth Championships." .

