ns1:43756 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "China–Ukraine relations are foreign relations between Ukraine and People's Republic of China. Ukraine recognized the People's Republic of China in October 1949 and diplomatic ties were established in 1992. Ukraine has replaced the United States as the largest exporter of corn to People's Republic of China, and has begun supplying People's Republic of China with modern jet engines for military craft." .

