ns1:46389 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The year 2018 in Glory is the seventh year in the history of the Glory, an international kickboxing promotion. The following fighters won the GLORY Kickboxing year-end awards for 2018 in Glory: Glory 50: Chicago was a kickboxing event held by Glory on 2018, at the UIC Pavilion in Chicago, US. Glory 51: Rotterdam \"Bad Blood\" was a kickboxing event held on 2018, at Rotterdam Ahoy in Rotterdam, Netherlands. Glory 52: Los Angeles was a kickboxing event held on 2018, at the Long Beach Arena in Los Angeles, California, US. Bonus awards: The following fighter has been awarded $5,000 bonus: Glory 53: Lille was a kickboxing event held on 2018, at the Zénith de Lille in Lille, France. Bonus awards: The following fighter has been awarded $5,000 bonus: Glory 54: Birmingham was a kickboxing event held on 2018, at the Genting Arena in Birmingham, England. Bonus awards: The following fighter has been awarded $5,000 bonus: Glory 55: New York was a kickboxing event held on 2018, at Hulu Theater in New York City, New York, US. Bonus awards: The following fighter has been awarded $5,000 bonus: Glory 56: Denver was a kickboxing event held on 2018, at the 1stBank Center in Broomfield, US. Glory 57: Shenzhen was a kickboxing event held on 2018, at the Shenzhen Bay Sports Center in Shenzhen, China. Bonus awards: The following fighter has been awarded $5,000 bonus: Glory 58: Chicago was a kickboxing event held on 2018, at the Sears Centre in Hoffman Estates, US. Bonus awards: The following fighter has been awarded $5,000 bonus: Glory 59: Amsterdam was a kickboxing event held on 2018, at the Johan Cruyff Arena in Amsterdam, Netherlands. Bonus awards: The following fighter has been awarded $5,000 bonus: Glory 60: Lyon was a kickboxing event held on 2018, at the Palais des Sports de Gerland in Lyon, France. Bonus awards: The following fighter has been awarded $5,000 bonus: Glory 61: New York was a kickboxing event held on 2018, at the Hammerstein Ballroom in New York City, U