ns1:47087 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "San Marino in the Junior Eurovision Song Contest 2014 selected their Junior Eurovision Song Contest 2014 entry through an internal selection. On 2014 it was revealed that The Peppermints would represent San Marino in the Junior Eurovision Song Contest 2014 in the contest with the song \"Breaking My Heart\". On 2014, it was revealed that the Italian/San Marino girl band The Peppermints, would represent San Marino in the Junior Eurovision Song Contest 2014 with song named \"Breaking My Heart\". At the running order draw which took place on 2014, San Marino in the Junior Eurovision Song Contest 2014 were drawn to perform third on 2014, following Bulgaria and preceding Croatia." .

