ns1:51306 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Australian women's cricket team in England in 2005 toured England in August and 2005. However, in the match that was played on 31 July, Australia beat the Irish women's cricket team by 240 runs, Karen Rolton and Lisa Sthalekar both making centuries as Australia made 295 for 3, and Cecelia Joyce top-scored for Ireland with a paltry 18 - Shelley Nitschke taking four for 15 as Ireland collapsed to 55 all out in 26 overs." .

ns1:51308 a ns1:context_narration ;
