ns1:53042 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "48HOURS is a New Zealand film-making competition. Developed from the US-based 48 Hour Film Project, which was run in Auckland in 2003, 48HOURS has been running as a New Zealand-only event since 2004. After initially being held in Auckland in 2003 as part of the international 48 Hour Film Project, the independent 48HOURS began in 2004 with teams in Auckland and Wellington." .

