ns1:55510 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Pro Tour was introduced in 1996 with the first event being held in New York. On February 16–18, 1996 the first Pro Tour, very briefly called The Black Lotus Pro Tour, was held in New York. Pro Tours started as single-format events in 1996, alternating between Constructed and Limited, with the exception of the World Championships which have been multi-format events since the inception of the Pro Tour. Beginning in 1996–97 one Pro Tour was held in Europe each season." .

