ns1:60114 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Infierno en el Ring (Spanish for \"Inferno in the Ring\") was a major professional wrestling event produced and scripted by the Mexican lucha libre promotion Consejo Mundial de Lucha Libre (CMLL) that took place on Friday December 25, 2016 in Arena México, Mexico City. Each of the shows has featured a main event, multi-man steel cage match, contested under Lucha de Apuestas, or bet match rules referred to as Infierno en el Ring. The 2016 Infierno en el Ring event was the second time that female competitors were in the steel cage as La Jarochita, Sanely, Princesa Sugehit, La Vaquerita, Metálica and Zeuxis put their mask on the line while Marcela, Estellita, Dalys and La Amapola risked their hair on the outcome of the match. All Infierno en el Ring shows have been held in Arena México in Mexico City which is CMLL's main venue, its promotional \"home\". The event featured five professional wrestling matches with different wrestlers involved in pre-existing scripted feuds, plots and storylines." .

