ns1:41361 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2009 Interwetten Austrian Open Kitzbühel is a men's tennis tournament played on outdoor clay courts. It is the 29th edition of the Austrian Open Kitzbühel and was part of the World Tour 250 series of the 2009 ATP World Tour. It was held at the Tennis stadium Kitzbühel in Kitzbuehel Austria from 16 May 2009 until 23 May 2009." .

ns1:41363 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Sannin shogi (三人将棋 three-person chess), or in full kokusai sannin shōgi (国際三人将棋 international three-person chess), is a three-person Shogi variant invented circa 1930 by Tanigasaki Jisuke and recently revived. However, except for castling and the promoted king, which is reminiscent of the queen of Western chess (indeed, it moves like the queen in hexagonal chess), the pieces are fair analogues of their standard-shōgi counterparts." .

