ns1:41671 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Battle of Qurna was a battle during the Iraq War between the Multinational force in Iraq and Iraqi insurgents. The battle took part in Al-Qurnah. In the battle, the insurgents tried to take the control of the city from the allies, mainly Danish, Lithuanian and United Kingdom soldiers." .

