ns1:41694 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2017 World Figure Skating Championships were held 29 March 2017 – 02 April 2017 in Helsinki, Finland. The following new ISU Judging System were set during this competition: Participants were required to have attained minimum technical element scores at an earlier senior international competition. The International Skating Union published a complete list on 2017." .

ns1:41699 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2015 Supercopa Euroamericana was the first edition of Supercopa Euroamericana, a men's association football friendly tournament created by DirecTV, disputed between the Copa Sudamericana and the UEFA Europa League winners. The match was played in 2015 by Club Atlético River Plate, the 2014 Copa Sudamericana champions, and Sevilla, the 2013–14 UEFA Europa League champions. Club Atlético River Plate won the match 1–0." .

