ns1:41829 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2015 South Korean Figure Skating Championships (Korean: 제69회 전국 남녀 피겨스케이팅 종합선수권대회) was the South Korean Figure Skating Championships for the 2014-2015 season. The competition was held between 07 January 2015 and 09 January 2015, 2015 at the Mokdong Ice Rink in Seoul. The team to the 2015 World Championships was announced as follows: The team to the 2015 Four Continents Championships was announced as follows: The team to the 2015 World Junior Championships was announced as follows: 2015 South Korean Figure Skating Championships." .

