ns1:41926 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Battle of Dubienka occurred during the Polish–Russian War of 1792 (War of the Second Partition of Poland) where on 18 July 1792, the Polish army under the command of General Tadeusz Kościuszko defended the Bug River crossing against the Russian army under General Michail Kachovski. One week after this battle Poland capitulated." .

