ns1:42068 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2000 Toray Pan Pacific Open was a women's tennis tournament played on indoor carpet courts. It was the 17th edition of the Pan Pacific Open, and was part of the WTA Tier I tournaments of the 2000 WTA Tour. It took place at the Tokyo Metropolitan Gymnasium in Tokyo, Japan, from 29 January 2000 through 06 February 2000." .

ns1:42072 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Pleasantville Music Festival is a single-day music festival which takes place annually at Parkway Field in Pleasantville, New York." .

ns1:42075 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2018–19 Indian cricket season was the 126th cricket season since the commencement of first-class cricket in India. The new T20 Challenger Trophy started the domestic season in August.India Blue Women defeated India Red women by 4 runs to win the inaugural trophy. In February and March 2019, South Africa Under-19 cricket team toured India to play 2-match Youth Test series against India Under-19 cricket team. India Green Under-23 Women defeated India Blue Under-23 Women by 8 wickets to win the tournament. Women's U23 T20 Challenger Trophy was played from 4 to 8 October 2018 at Mysuru. India Green Under-23 Women defeated India Blue Under-23 Women by 8 wickets in the final to win the tournament." .

ns1:42078 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2012 Monza GP2 series round and the 2012 Monza GP2 and GP3 Series rounds were a group of motor races held at the Autodromo Nazionale Monza near Monza in Italy for the GP2 and GP3 Series championships." .

ns1:42079 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "United Nations Security Council Resolution 1918, adopted unanimously on 27 April 2010, after recalling resolutions 1814 (2008), 1816 (2008), 1838 (2008), 1844 (2008), 1846 (2008), 1851 (2008) and 1897 (2008) on Somalia, the Council called on countries to criminalise piracy within their national laws." .

ns1:42091 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The annual Bodmin Riding custom was held at Bodmin in Cornwall, England, UK, on the Sunday and Monday after 7 July (St Thomas Becket's Day). The earliest documentary evidence of the custom is in the Bodmin Parish Church rebuilding accounts of 1469-72, and it ceased in the early 19th century, but was revived in 1974 and now forms part of Bodmin Riding and Heritage Day Festival." .

ns1:42103 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2012 Morocco Tennis Tour – Marrakech was a professional tennis tournament played on hard courts. It took place in Marrakech, Morocco between 19 March 2012 and 2012." .

ns1:42108 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Spirit of Burgas is a summer music festival in the city of Burgas, on the Black Sea coast of Bulgaria. On 31 January 2016 Burgas Municipality festival director announces in a radio interview that the festival organisation is put on hold due to lack of interest among the Bulgarian promoters and Spirit of Burgas are still looking for a festival promoter." .

ns1:42111 a ns1:context_narration ;
