ns1:42149 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The ChillOut Festival is held in Daylesford every year on the Victorian Labour Day long weekend in March. It commenced in 1997 and is now the largest LGBTQI festival in regional Australia, and also the largest festival of any kind in the Shire of Hepburn." .

ns1:42150 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "In heraldry, murrey is a \"stain\", i. e. a non-standard tincture, that is a dark reddish purple colour." .

ns1:42153 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "World Airways Flight 30 was a McDonnell Douglas DC-10-30CF airliner which suffered a fatal accident upon landing at Logan International Airport in Boston after departing Newark International Airport (now Newark Liberty International Airport) in Newark, New Jersey on 23 January 1982." .

ns1:42155 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2009 Odisha Legislative Assembly election took place in 2009, concurrently with the general election. With the tenure of the Orissa Assembly scheduled to expire on 2009, the Election Commission of India announced on 2 March that year that the elections to the Assembly would be held alongside the general election. Naveen Patnaik then won a controversial trust vote on 2009, after the opposition Congress and BJP legislators walked out of the Assembly in protest in the manner the vote was being conducted." .

ns1:42157 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2007 UAW-Ford 500 was the 30th stock car race of the 2007 NASCAR Nextel Cup Series and the fourth in the ten-race season-ending Chase for the Nextel Cup. It was held on 07 October 2007 at Talladega Superspeedway in Talladega, Alabama, before a crowd of 155,000. It was held on 07 October 2007 at Talladega Superspeedway in Talladega, Alabama, a superspeedway that holds NASCAR races. As Johnson went to block his teammate, Stewart bump-drafted Jeff Gordon to give the latter the lead, which he held to clinch his fifth victory of the season, the 80th of his career, and a season sweep of victories at Talladega Superspeedway." .

ns1:42163 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2007 Island Games were the 12th edition of the Island Games, and were held in Rhodes, Greece, from 30 June 2007 to 06 July 2007." .

ns1:42166 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2015 Tour of Belgium was the 85th edition of the Tour of Belgium cycling stage race. It took place from 28 May to 1 June 2015 in Belgium, and was part of the 2015 UCI Europe Tour." .

ns1:42174 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "United Nations Security Council Resolution 1619, adopted unanimously on 11 August 2005, after reaffirming previous United Nations Security Council resolution on Iraq, particularly United Nations Security Council resolution 1500 (2003), 1546 (2004) and 1557 (2004), the Council extended the mandate of the United Nations Assistance Mission in Iraq (UNAMI) for a further period of twelve months." .

