ns1:42185 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1989 Malawi earthquake occurred on 10 March 1989 in central Malawi, with a moment magnitude of 6.3 and a maximum Mercalli intensity of VII (Very strong). A field study conducted in October 1989 concluded that the 10 March 1989 earthquake \"should be treated as an eye opener, drawing attention to the potential of medium-size earthquakes hitting major cities in Malawi\"." .

ns1:42195 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Giants–Jets rivalry is an American football rivalry in the National Football League (NFL) between the New York Giants and New York Jets. The New York Jets previously maintained a very tense rivalry with their in-town counterparts, the New York Giants, a rivalry that has since diminished due to the infrequency with which the teams meet in the regular season." .

ns1:42203 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The track and field at the 2011 Military World Games – women's 3000 metres steeplechase event at the athletics at the 2011 Military World Games was held on 19 July at the Estádio Olímpico João Havelange." .

