    rdfs:label "The 2015 Formula Renault 2.0 NEC season was the tenth Formula Renault 2.0 Northern European Cup season, an open-wheel motor racing series for emerging young racing drivers based in Europe." .

ns1:42210 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2011 Poznań Porsche Open was a professional tennis tournament played on clay courts. It took place at the Park Tenisowy Olimpia in Poznań, Poland from 16 to 24 July 2011, including the qualifying competition in the first two days." .

ns1:42212 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Hurricane Eloise was the most destructive tropical cyclone of the 1975 Atlantic hurricane season. Hurricane Eloise continued to strengthen until it reached its peak winds of 125 mph (205 km/h) and a minimum barometric pressure of about 955 mbar (hPa; 28.2 inHg). Following the severe damage caused by Hurricane Eloise, its name was retired at the end of the 1975 season and will never again be used for an Atlantic hurricane." .

