ns1:42567 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Hungary in the Eurovision Song Contest 2007 returned to the Eurovision Song Contest 2007 after skipping the 2006 Contest. The Hungarian entrant at the Eurovision Song Contest 2007 was selected through the \"Newcomer of the Year\" category of the 2007 Fonogram Hungarian Music Awards, which took place on 2007 at the Jövő Háza Theater in Budapest. Due to missing the 2006 contest, Hungary in the Eurovision Song Contest 2007 had to compete in the semi-final of the Eurovision Song Contest 2007. As Hungary in the Eurovision Song Contest 2007 was not the winner of the 2007 Contest and was not a member of the Big Four, other results in the previous contest no longer pre-qualified nations to the final of the forthcoming contest." .

