    rdfs:label "They were joined a week later by FC Metz, after a 4–0 home defeat against Lorient. were the first team promoted from National, after a 4–0 victory against Istres on 8 May 2015, marking their return to the professional levels after sixteen years in the amateur leagues. Paris FC and FC Bourg-Péronnas only gained the right to promote on the last day of the season, when Paris FC drew 0–0 against CA Bastia and FC Bourg-Péronnas won 1–0 against Boulogne." .

