ns1:43017 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2011 Suruga Bank Championship (Japanese: スルガ銀行チャンピオンシップ2011; Spanish: Copa Suruga Bank 2011) was the fourth edition of the J.League Cup / Copa Sudamericana Championship, the club association football match co-organized by the Japan Football Association, the association football governing body of Japan, and CONMEBOL, the association football governing body of South America, between the winners of the previous season's J. Júbilo Iwata won 4–2 in penalty shootout, after drawing 2–2 in the ninety minutes of play." .

ns1:43018 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The First Battle of Clusium was a battle that took place in June of 82 BC during the Roman Republic's Sulla's second civil war. The battle is generally referred to as a stalemate, but the German scholar, Theodor Mommsen affirmed the following: Philip Matyszak disagrees: The next day Sulla retreated from the area, leaving Carbo behind at Clusium." .

