ns1:43157 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Hopman Cup XXIV (also known as the 2012 Hopman Cup for sponsorship reasons) corresponds to the 24th edition of the Hopman Cup tournament between nations in men's and women's tennis. The tournament commenced on 31 December 2011 at the Crown Perth in Perth, Western Australia. The 2012 2012 Hopman Cup was an invitational tennis tournament and is also known as the Official Mixed Teams Championships of the ITF." .

ns1:43159 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1987 European Cup Winners' Cup Final was a association football match contested between AFC Ajax of Netherlands and 1. FC Lokomotive Leipzig of East Germany. It was the final match of the 1986–87 European Cup Winners' Cup and the 27th European Cup Winners' Cup final. The final was held at Olympic Stadium of Athens in Athens, Greece. AFC Ajax won the match 1–0 with a 20th-minute header from Marco van Basten." .

