ns1:43414 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Ilosaarirock is an annual rock festival held on the second weekend of July in Joensuu, Eastern Finland. Founded in 1971, Ilosaarirock is the second oldest rock festival in Finland still active, and one of the oldest in Europe. The Ilosaarirock festival is organised by Joensuu Pop Musicians' Association, which is a non-profit organisation." .

ns1:43418 a ns1:context_narration ;
