ns1:43554 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Sedgefield by-election, 2007 was a by-election held on 19 July 2007 for the British House of Commons constituency of Sedgefield in County Durham. The Ealing Southall by-election was also held on 19 July 2007. According to Sedgefield Borough Council, the electorate for the by-election was 67,339 which represents an increase of 673 (1%) on the 2005 United Kingdom general election." .

ns1:43558 a ns1:context_narration ;
