ns1:44338 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2016–17 Saudi Professional League (also known as the Jameel League for sponsorship reasons) was the 41st season of Saudi Professional League, the top Saudi professional league for association football clubs, since its inception in 1976. The season started on 11 12 August 2016 and concluded on 04 May 2017. The league comprises 14 teams, 11 from the 2015–16 Saudi Professional League, as well as two teams promoted from the 2015–16 First Division and the 2015–16 Saudi Professional League winners." .

ns1:44339 a ns1:context_narration ;
