ns1:44563 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1949 Pelileo earthquake was the largest earthquake in the Western Hemisphere in more than five years. On 05 August 1949, it struck Ecuador's Tungurahua Province southeast of its capital Ambato and killed 5,050 people. At the time it struck the 1949 Pelileo earthquake was the second-worst earthquake in Ecuador's modern history topped only by the 1797 Riobamba earthquake, and the most devastating earthquake in the Western Hemisphere since the 1944 San Juan earthquake. Several major earthquakes have occurred throughout the country since 1949, including the 1987 Ecuador earthquakes and the 1997 Ecuador earthquake." .

ns1:44566 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2008 Suwon Samsung Bluewings season was Suwon Samsung Bluewings FC's thirteenth season in the K-League in South Korea." .

ns1:44567 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "2012 Egyptian Shura Council election were held in Egypt between 29 January 2012 and 22 February 2012. The elections were held in two stages; a first stage on 29 January 2012 and 30 January, with run-5 Februaryffs o6 FebruaryFebruary, and a14 Februaryecond15 February4 and 15 F21 Februaryruary22 Februaryoffs on 21 and 22 February 2012. There were originally plans to hold the elections in three stages, wi4 Marchh5 Marchird stage t11 Marchi12 March on 4–5 March and run-offs on 11–12 March, but in early 29 January 2012, the election process was sped up to shorten the transition period." .

