ns1:44579 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Lancashire Plate was a flat horse race in Great Britain open to Thoroughbreds aged two years and over. The Lancashire Plate was first run on 22 September 1888 over seven furlongs at Manchester Racecourse." .

ns1:44580 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1886 Ontario general election was the sixth general election held in the Province of Ontario, Canada. It was held on 28 December 1886, to elect the 90 Members of the 6th Legislative Assembly of Ontario (\"MLAs\"). The Ontario Liberal Party, led by Oliver Mowat, won a fifth consecutive term in government and an increased majority in the Legislature." .

ns1:44581 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Norway Rock Festival, formerly known as Kvinesdal Rock Festival, is a rock and metal music festival held annually in Kvinesdal, Norway since 2006. Norway Rock Festival is unofficially known as “Norway’s response to Woodstock” “Norway’s best rock music festival” and “The summer’s most beautiful music festival adventure” by the press and the audience who return year after year to experience the music festival's peculiar rock soul where freedom, independence and pure love of proper music permeates every inch of the area." .

