    rdfs:label "Bangladesh participated in the Bangladesh at the 2016 South Asian Games in Guwahati and Shillong, Bangladesh from 5 February to 2016." .

ns1:44849 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "National Airlines Flight 101 was a scheduled flight from Newark Liberty International Airport, New Jersey, to Miami, Florida, that on 11 February 1952 crashed in the town of Elizabeth, New Jersey, shortly after take-off." .

ns1:44858 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2007 Copa Aerosur, was an instance of the annual Bolivia association football tournament held in La Paz, Cochabamba and Santa Cruz, sponsored by the AeroSur airline. The 2007 version of the cup had three novelties: ties were defined by penalty shoot-out in all instances of the tournament; the implementation of a parallel U-18 tournament U-18; a rematch to be played between its champion and the champion of the Copa Aerosur del Sur and 2 foreign clubs." .

