ns1:44867 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1966 Southern 500, the 17th running of the Bojangles' Southern 500, was a NASCAR Grand National Series Bojangles' Southern 500 that was held on 05 September 1966, at Darlington Raceway in Darlington, South Carolina. Darlington Raceway, nicknamed by many NASCAR fans and drivers as \"The Lady in Black\" or \"The Track Too Tough to Tame\" and advertised as a \"NASCAR Tradition\", is a race track built for NASCAR racing located near Darlington, South Carolina." .

ns1:44868 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2010/2011 Badminton Europe Circuit season started in 01 May 2010 and ended in May 2011." .

ns1:44869 a ns1:context_narration ;
