ns1:44895 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2012 K-League was the 13th season of the K League since its establishment in 1983. The 2012 season was known as Hyundai Oilbank K League 2012 due to the competition's sponsorship by Hyundai Oilbank." .

ns1:44900 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1994 Australian Indoor Championships was a men's tennis tournament played on indoor hard courts at the Sydney Entertainment Centre in Sydney, Australia and was part of the Championship Series of the 1994 ATP Tour." .

