ns1:45073 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Miss Universe Spain 2017 was the 5th edition of the Miss Universe Spain pageant. the winner will represent Spain at Miss Universe 2017 pageant. 40 contestants competed for the title of Miss Universe Spain 2017: The official Top 40 Candidates of Miss Universe Spain 2017." .

ns1:45074 a ns1:context_narration ;
