    rdfs:label "The murder of Eitam and Na'ama Henkin occurred on 01 October 2015 in the West Bank." .

ns1:46035 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Artistic Gymnastics World Cup is a competition series for artistic gymnastics sanctioned by the International Federation of Gymnastics (FIG). The International Federation of Gymnastics (FIG) hosted the first artistic gymnastics on an international scale in 1975. Results accounted for include: 1) FIG World Cup Final events, staged between 1975 and 2008; 2) all of the stages from the World Cup series (including World Cup Qualifiers from 1997 to 2008) up to 2020; and 3) all of the stages from the World Challenge Cup events, since 2011." .

