ns1:46056 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The swimming at the 2000 Summer Olympics – men's 1500 metre freestyle event at the 2000 Summer Olympics took place on 22 September 2000–23 September at the Sydney Olympic Park Aquatic Centre in Sydney, Australia. Australia's Grant Hackett denied his teammate and sentimental favourite Kieren Perkins a third straight title in the event." .

ns1:46058 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Maritime Central Airways Flight 315 was an international charter flight from London, England to Toronto, Ontario, Canada, with refueling stops in Reykjavík, Iceland, and Goose Bay, Newfoundland. On 11 August 1957, the aircraft operating this flight, a Douglas DC-4, crashed in bad weather 7.2 kilometres (4.5 mi) west of Issoudun, Quebec, killing all 79 people on board." .

ns1:46059 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "In 2013, the 2013 Campeonato Brasileiro Série D, the fourth division of the Brazilian League, will be contested for the fifth time in history. The 40 teams are divided in eight groups of 5, playing within them in a double round-robin format. However, teams who were not promoted will have to re-qualify for 2014 Campeonato Brasileiro Série D through their respective state leagues.The competition can also be considered as 4 mini-tournaments (Group 1+2;3+4;5+6;7+8) because according to the playoff-structure, exactly one team of each \"mini-tournament\" will be promoted." .

ns1:46064 a ns1:context_narration ;
