ns1:46161 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2013–14 Toros Mexico season was the fifth season of the Toros Mexico professional indoor soccer club and second under the \"Toros Mexico\" name. Unlike the 17 US-based PASL teams, Toros Mexico and the other two Mexico-based teams did not participate in the 2013–14 United States Open Cup for Arena Soccer." .

ns1:46162 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1954 Australian Championships was a tennis tournament that took place on outdoor grass courts at the White City Tennis Club, Sydney, Australia from 22 January 1954 to 01 February 1954. It was the 42nd edition of the Australian Championships (now known as the Australian Open), the 12th held in Sydney, and the first Grand Slam tournament of the year." .

ns1:46164 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Battle of Booneville was fought on 01 July 1862, in Booneville, during the American Civil War." .

ns1:46166 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2010 Kaohsiung earthquakes, measuring 6.3 Mw, occurred on 04 March 2010 at 8:20 a.m. local time. The earthquake caused the tripping of several power stations in Taiwan, leading to a loss of 1,860 MW of electricity." .

ns1:46168 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1959–60 FA Cup was the 79th staging of the world's oldest association football cup competition, the Football Association Challenge Cup, commonly known as the FA Cup. Wolverhampton Wanderers F.C. won the competition for the fourth time, beating Blackburn Rovers 3–0 in the 1960 FA Cup Final at Wembley." .

ns1:46169 a ns1:context_narration ;
