    rdfs:label "Midrash Tadshe (Hebrew: מדרש תדשא) is a Smaller midrashim which begins with an interpretation of Gen. 1:11: \"And God said, Let the earth bring forth\" (\"Tadshe ha-aretz\")." .

ns1:46215 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Men's Roller Derby World Cup is an international tournament in the sport of men's roller derby. The first World Cup was held between 2014–2014 in Birmingham, England. The participating countries were: The final rankings released after the Men's Roller Derby World Cup 2014 are as follows: In 2015 The organisers of the Men's Roller Derby World Cup announced that the next World Cup would be held in July 2016, in Calgary, Alberta, Canada." .

