    rdfs:label "The 2012 Formula Renault 3.5 Series season was the eighth season of the Renault–supported single–seater Formula Renault 3.5 Series. On 10 October 2011 Formula Renault 3.5 Series season, it was announced that 18 teams had applied to compete in the 2012 season. In August 2011 Formula Renault 3.5 Series season, series organisers had announced that the championship was due to visit Russia and Brazil during the 2012 season. The 2012 calendar was announced on 10 October 2011 Formula Renault 3.5 Series season, the day after the end of the 2011 Formula Renault 3.5 Series season season." .

