    rdfs:label "The biathlon at the 2010 Winter Olympics – women's mass start competition of the Vancouver 2010 Olympics was held at Whistler Olympic Park in Whistler, British Columbia on 2010." .

ns1:46670 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2006 Spa 24 Hours was the fourth race for the 2006 FIA GT Championship season." .

ns1:46682 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1953 Major League Baseball season was contested from April 13 to 12 October 1953. The New York Yankees won their fifth consecutive World Series championship, an Major League Baseball record." .

ns1:46685 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "1918 Danish Landsting election were held in Denmark on 11 May 1918, with the exceptions that the seats elected by the resigning parliament were elected on 20 March 1918, the Faroese member was elected on 13 May, and the electors that elected the candidates standing in the constituencies were elected on 30 April." .

ns1:46688 a ns1:context_narration ;
