ns1:47873 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Battle of Zhvanets, or the Siege of Zhvanets (Polish: Bitwa pod Żwańcem) was one of battles of the Khmelnytsky Uprising. When news of this reached King Jan Kazimierz Waza, he decided to abandon his positions in Bar, Ukraine, and head towards Zhvanets, to await Moldavian and Transilvanian reinforcements." .

