ns1:48053 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2015 SpongeBob SquarePants 400 was a NASCAR Sprint Cup Series race held on 09 May 2015, ending shortly after midnight on May 10, 2015 at Kansas Speedway in Kansas City, Kansas. This was the 73rd career victory for Jimmie Johnson, third at Kansas Speedway and sixth at the track for Hendrick Motorsports. Kansas Speedway is a 1.5-mile (2.4 km) tri-oval race track in Kansas City, Kansas." .

ns1:48057 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Firozabad rail disaster occurred on 20 August 1995 near Firozabad on the Delhi-Kanpur section of India's Northern Railway, at 02:55 when a passenger train collided with a train which had stopped after hitting a cow, killing 358 people (although some sources estimate the deaths at more than 400)." .

ns1:48058 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Fifteenth Ordinary General Assembly of the Synod of Bishops was a Roman Catholic synod that took place 03 October 2018–28 October 2018 and had as its theme \"Young People, Faith, and Vocational Discernment\". On 03 October 2018, Synod members representing a wide range of views were elected to serve on the synod's \"Information Committee\", which controls the release of information to the press and public." .

ns1:48061 a ns1:context_narration ;
