ns1:48106 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1938 Cupa României Final was the fifth final of Romania's most prestigious association football cup competition. It was disputed between CAM Timișoara and FC Rapid București, and was won by FC Rapid București after a game with 5 goals. CAM Timișoara was the first club representing Divizia B which reached the Romanian Cup final." .

ns1:48107 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Battles of Batočina and Jagodina were several battles fought between 23 March 1804 and 27 March 1804 in Batočina and Jagodina (central Serbia) between the Serbian Revolutionaries under Karađorđe and the Dahije (renegade Janissaries) under Kučuk-Alija." .

