    rdfs:label "The 2012–13 Gonzaga Bulldogs men's basketball team represented Gonzaga University in the 2012–13 NCAA Division I men's basketball season. In 2012–13, the Gonzaga Bulldogs men's basketball team were in their 33rd season as a member of the West Coast Conference. In their 2011–12 Gonzaga Bulldogs men's basketball team, a West Coast Conference Preseason Poll predicted that the Gonzaga Bulldogs would finish atop of the conference. Before the 2012–13 season, the Gonzaga Bulldogs men's basketball team lost two seniors from the previous year to graduation: starter Robert Sacre and transfer Marquise Carter." .

