ns1:49182 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1959 Governor General's Awards were the 24th rendition of the Governor General's Awards, Canada's annual national awards program which then comprised literary awards alone. The awards recognized Canadian writers for new works published in Canada during 1959. Canada Council for the Arts took over administration of the program sometime during 1959 or 1960 – after the 1958 Governor General's Awards that recognized 1958 publications." .

ns1:49184 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The athletics at the 2017 Summer Universiade – women's 4 × 400 metres relay event at the athletics at the 2017 Summer Universiade was held on 27 August and 28 August at the Taipei Municipal Stadium." .

ns1:49186 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "2007 Svenska Supercupen, Swedish Super Cup 2007, was a association football match played on 2007 between Allsvenskan 2006 champions IF Elfsborg and Svenska Cupen 2006 winners Helsingborgs IF. The attendance wasn't very positive for the new Swedish tournament, only 1,240 saw the match on Borås Arena." .

ns1:49189 a ns1:context_narration ;
