ns1:49216 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1996 CONCACAF Champions' Cup was the 32nd edition of the annual international club football competition held in the CONCACAF region (North America, Central America and the Caribbean), the CONCACAF Champions' Cup. It determined that year's club champion of association football in the CONCACAF region and was played from 1996 through 1996. Club Deportivo Cruz Azul from Mexico won the final, its fourth CONCACAF championship." .

ns1:49218 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Israel at the 2003 Summer Universiade competed at the 2003 Summer Universiade also known as the XXI Summer Universiade, in Daegu, South Korea." .

