ns1:49296 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2007–08 Cypriot Cup was the 66th edition of the Cypriot Cup. It began on 08 September 2007 with the first round and concluded on 17 May 2008 with the final which was held at GSP Stadium. APOEL F.C. won their 19th Cypriot Cup trophy after beating Anorthosis Famagusta FC 2–0 in the final. ASPIS Pylas which finished first in the 2007 STOK promotion play-offs, participated in the Cypriot Cup." .

