ns1:49538 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "2005 Djiboutian presidential election were held in Djibouti on 08 April 2005. The main opposition parties in Djibouti did not put up a candidate in the presidential election and called on their supporters to boycott the election. Guelleh was sworn in as President for a second term on 2005 and pledged to increase economic development in Djibouti." .

ns1:49539 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2012–13 Svenska Cupen was the 57th season of Svenska Cupen and the first season since 2000–01 to be held according to the fall-spring season format. The first round commenced on 03 June 2012 and the final was contested on 26 May 2013 at Friends Arena in Solna. IFK Göteborg won their sixth Svenska Cupen title on 26 May 2013 after defeating Djurgårdens IF 3–1 on penalties after the match had finished 1–1 after extra time." .

