ns1:49651 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Tour de Moluccas(abbreviated TdM) is an annual professional road bicycle racing stage race held in Maluku, Indonesia. The first international cycling competition Tour de Moluccas (TdM) 2017 was held September 18 and end on September 23." .

