ns1:49885 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1980 Open Championship was a men's major golf championship and the 109th The Open Championship, held from 17 July–20 July at Muirfield in Gullane, Scotland. Tom Watson won his third The Open Championship, four strokes ahead of runner-up Lee Trevino." .

