ns1:50907 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "A special election was held on 11 April 2017, to determine the member of the United States House of Representatives for Kansas's 4th congressional district after the incumbent, Mike Pompeo, resigned because of his nomination by President Donald Trump as Director of the Central Intelligence Agency. Republican Ron Kansas's 4th congressional district special election, 2017 received 52.2% of the vote and won, while runner-up Democrat 2018 United States House of Representatives elections in Kansas lost with 46% of the vote. The day following Pompeo's resignation, Brownback declared a special election to take place on 11 April 2017. Kansas's 4th congressional district special election, 2017 won the election by 6.2% over political newcomer 2018 United States House of Representatives elections in Kansas. The Associated Press called the election for Kansas's 4th congressional district special election, 2017 while he was leading by 6% with 88% of precincts reporting." .

ns1:50908 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1993 Uganda Super League was the 26th season of the official Ugandan football championship, the top-level football league of Uganda. The 1993 Uganda Super League was contested by 15 teams and was won by Express F.C., while Wandegeya FC, Busia and Uganda Airlines were relegated." .

ns1:50911 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Need-fire, or Wild-fire (German: Notfeuer, Old High German: nodfyr, Scottish Gaelic: tein'-éigin, Russian: Живой огонь) is a term used in folklore to denote a superstition which survived in the Scottish Highlands until a recent date." .

ns1:50918 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Summer Sixteen Tour was a co-headlining concert tour by Canadian rapper Drake, and American rapper Future. Scheduled for 60 performances across North America, the tour was produced by Apple Music in conjunction with Drake's fourth studio album, Views, Future's fourth studio album Evol, as well as their collaborative mixtape What a Time to Be Alive." .

ns1:50919 a ns1:context_narration ;
