    rdfs:label "The 27th Golden Horse Film Awards (Mandarin:第27屆金馬獎) took place on 10 December 1990 at National Theater in Taipei, Taiwan." .

ns1:51314 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2013 ITS Cup was a professional tennis tournament played on outdoor clay court. It took place in Olomouc, Czech Republic, on 2013–21 July 2013." .

ns1:51317 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1944 All-Ireland Senior Camogie Championship Final was the thirteenth All-Ireland Final and the deciding match of the All-Ireland Senior Camogie Championship 1944, an inter-county camogie tournament for the top teams in Ireland." .

ns1:51320 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1954–55 Rheinlandliga was the third season of the highest amateur class of the Rhineland Football Association under the name of Amateurliga Rheinland." .

ns1:51326 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2014 African Handball Cup Winners' Cup was the 20th edition, organized by the African Handball Confederation, under the auspices of the International Handball Federation, the international handball sport governing body. The tournament was held from May 20–29, 2014 in Oyo, Republic of the Congo, contested by 7 teams and won by Espérance Sportive de Tunis of Tunisia." .

ns1:51342 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2012 Afghan Premier League is the first season of the Afghan Premier League, the Afghan league for association football clubs, since its establishment in 2012. All 8 teams are spread out across Afghanistan, but all the matches would be played at the Afghanistan Football Federation stadium in Kabul." .

