ns1:51363 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2015–16 Indian Women's Football Championship was the 21st edition of India women's football championship, the women's state competition in Indian football." .

ns1:51378 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "An indirect 1984 West German presidential election (officially the 8th Federal Convention) was held in West Germany on 23 May 1984." .

ns1:51387 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2015–16 NBA season was the 70th season of the National Basketball Association. The regular season began on Tuesday, 27 October 2015 at the United Center, home of the Chicago Bulls, with their game against the Cleveland Cavaliers. The regular season began on Tuesday, 27 October 2015 at the United Center, home of the Chicago Bulls, who hosted a game against the Cleveland Cavaliers at 8:00 p.m. EDT, then the Atlanta Hawks hosted the Detroit Pistons at 8:00 p.m. EDT." .

ns1:51393 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Since 2008 the festival takes place in the capital of Cyclades, Ermoupolis of Syros, and includes animation movies screenings, special tributes to international festivals, professional forum with the participation of distinguished Greek and foreign creators and professionals, workshops for students and children, the applied follow-up workshop “making of”, parties and other parallel events. Animasyros is the largest animation festival in Greece and one of the 20 largest of its kind in Europe. In 2014 Animasyros joined, after a decision taken by Syros- Ermoupolis’ City Council, the task group that will create and establish the proposal of the nomination “Syros- Cyclades 2021” - Cultural Capital of Europe. Animasyros is set every year under the auspices of the Municipality of Syros- Ermoupolis, the South Aegean Region, whereas receives the active support of both public, such as the General Secretariat for Gender Equality, the Ministry of Tourism, the University of Aegean, and private institutions, such as Onassis Cultural Centre, the Benaki Museum etc. Animasyros became part of this group and now works towards drafting and promoting the nomination, recognizing the uniqueness of Ermoupolis as well as of the whole archipelago as an integral monument of European cultural reference. At the same time, Animasyros strongly supports every initiative taken by the Municipality in its effort to get the historic site of Ermoupolis and the medieval settlement of Ano Syros included in the Unesco World Heritage List as the 18th Greek monument." .

ns1:51398 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "United Nations Security Council Resolution 614, adopted unanimously on 15 June 1988, noted a report of the Secretary-General that, due to the existing circumstances, the presence of the United Nations Peacekeeping Force in Cyprus (UNFICYP) would continue to be essential for a peaceful settlement." .

ns1:51399 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2012–13 UAE President's Cup is the 37th season of the UAE President's Cup, the premier knockout tournament for association football clubs in the United Arab Emirates." .

ns1:51402 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The All-Ireland Senior Hurling Championship 2010 was the 114th staging of Ireland's premier hurling competition since its establishment by the Gaelic Athletic Association in 1887." .

ns1:51412 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Washington County Fair is an annual event held at the Washington County Fairgrounds in Hillsboro, United States." .

ns1:51414 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Battle of Solicinium was fought in 368 between a Roman Empire army and the Alemanni. The Roman Empire force was led by Emperor Valentinian I, and they managed to repel the Alemanni but suffered heavy losses during the battle. The most recent research shows that the battle probably took place in the northern part of what is today Hechingen, and the lost city of \"Solicinium\" was located where the Roman Empire museum of Hechingen is located today." .

ns1:51417 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2016 Danish Individual Speedway Championship was the 2016 edition of the Danish Individual Speedway Championship." .

ns1:51419 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2016–17 Bandy Elitserien was the tenth season of the present highest Sweden men's bandy top division, Elitserien. Edsbyns IF won the Sweden national championship title by defeating Bollnäs GIF, 3–1, in the final game, thereby securing Edsbyn's tenth championship title, making the club alone the third most successful Sweden bandy club so far." .

ns1:51420 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1918 United States House of Representatives elections were held 05 November 1918, which occurred in the middle of President Woodrow Wilson's second term." .

ns1:51424 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "United Nations Security Council Resolution 246, adopted unanimously on 14 March 1968, after reaffirming previous resolution of the topic of the independence of South West Africa and the rights of its people, the Council censured the government of South Africa and demanded they release and repatriate the South West African prisoners in their custody." .

ns1:51428 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Fourth Zonal Exhibition of Leningrad artists of 1972 dedicated to 50th Anniversary of USSR (Russian: \"Четвёртая зональная выставка произведений ленинградских художников 1972 года, посвящённая 50-летию образования СССР\") was opened on September 22, in the Russian Museum as well as in Exhibition Halls of the Leningrad Union of Soviet Artists and become one of largest Art Exhibition of 1972 in the USSR." .

ns1:51431 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Fredericksburg Dog Mart is an annual dog show event currently held in Spotsylvania County." .

ns1:51432 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The death of Vincent van Gogh, the Dutch post-Impressionist painter, occurred in the early morning of Occurred in the early morning of 29 July 1890, in his room at the Auberge Ravoux in the village of Auvers-sur-Oise in northern France." .

ns1:51435 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1998 All England Badminton Championships was the 88th edition of the All England Badminton Championships. It was held from 9 to 14 March 1998, in Birmingham, England." .

ns1:51439 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The United Kingdom censuses of 1841 recorded the occupants of every United Kingdom household on the night of Sunday 06 June 1841." .

ns1:51441 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Refresh Festival is an annual music festival held in Maximus discothèque in Kotor, Montenegro. Refresh Festival 2007 was the first edition and it was held from August 9 to August 12. After the 2010 edition being held in Top Hill, Budva, in 2011 Refresh Festival festival returned to Kotor. Refresh Festival 2012 was held between August 9 and August 11 in Kotor and will include performances by Tiga, Cristian Varela, Marco Bailey, Nicola Fasano, Steve Forest and local DJ's. Refresh Festival 2013 was held between August 8 and August 10 in Kotor." .

ns1:51445 a ns1:context_narration ;
