ns1:52243 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Les Parrott draws a three-fold distinction between \"objective or legal guilt, which occurs when society's laws have been broken... social guilt... an unwritten law of social expectation\", and finally the way \"personal guilt occurs when someone compromises one's own standards\"." .

ns1:52251 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2013 FIBA Asia Championship qualification was held in late 2012 from early 2013 with the Gulf region, West Asia, Southeast Asia, East Asia, Central Asia and South Asia each conducting tournaments. On 2013, in Astana, Kazakhstan beat Uzbekistan 80–60 and was qualified for the 2013 FIBA Asia Championship. The 2013 South Asian Basketball Association Qualifying Round for the 27th FIBA Asia Championship is the qualifying tournament for the 2013 FIBA Asia Championship. The 10th Southeast Asia Basketball Association Championship is the qualifying tournament for the 2013 FIBA Asia Championship; it also serves as a regional championship involving Southeast Asian basketball teams. The 2013 West Asian Basketball Championship is the qualifying tournament for the 2013 FIBA Asia Championship." .

