ns1:52275 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Tai shogi (泰将棋 tai shōgi or 無上泰将棋 mujō tai shōgi \"grand chess\", renamed from 無上大将棋 mujō dai shōgi \"supreme chess\" to avoid confusion with 大将棋 dai shōgi) is a large-board Shogi variant of shogi (Japanese chess)." .

