ns1:52354 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2001 El Salvador earthquake struck El Salvador on 13 January 2001 at 17:33:34 UTC. The 13 January 2001 earthquake was a result of normal faulting within the subducting Cocos Plate as shown by the hypocentral depth and published focal mechanisms. Describing the 13 January 2001 earthquake as a 'natural disaster' is not only irresponsible, but also a declaration of future impotence." .

ns1:52361 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "But it was HB who probably should have won the match, as they were leading both 1-0 and 2-1, but allowed IBV to equalize twice, the second equalizer was just 2 minutes from time. But no match was played for the next 3 years, then in 2002 the Faroe Islands Football Association, the Football Association of Iceland and the fund FITUR (which provides support to the furthering of cooperation between The Faroe Islands and Iceland, in order to promote further relations between the countries), decided to make it an annual event, that the champions of Faroese and Icelandic leagues should meet in what became the Atlantic Cup." .

