ns1:53362 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Battle of Manila (Spanish: Batalla de Manila en el 1570) was fought in Manila between the native Filipinos led by Rajah Sulayman, a vassal to the Sultan of Brunei, and the Spaniards led by Martin de Goiti, Maestre de Campo on 24 May 1570. De Goiti arrived in 24 May 1570, anchored at Cavite on the mouth of Manila Bay." .

