ns1:53384 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Medvedev Forest massacre was a mass execution in the Soviet Union carried out by the NKVD on 11 September 1941. Barely three months after the German invasion of the Soviet Union, 157 political prisoners incarcerated at Oryol Prison were executed in Medvedev Forest, just outside Oryol, by personal order of Joseph Stalin." .

