ns1:53417 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The La Brea Fire was a fast-moving 2009 wildfire which occurred in Southern California in the United States. Under the command of Incident Commander Jeanne Pincha-Tulley, who leads California Interagency Incident Management Team 3, and unified command with CALFIRE and Santa Barbara County Fire, the firefighters battling the fire faced steep terrain which became a factor for the cautious pace in the containment." .

ns1:53421 a ns1:context_narration ;
