ns1:53853 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1975 CONCACAF Champions' Cup was the 11th edition of the annual international club football competition held in the CONCACAF region (North America, Central America and the Caribbean), the CONCACAF Champions' Cup. It determined that year's club champion of association football in the CONCACAF region and was played from 1975 till 9 May 1976. Atlético Español from Mexico won the final, and became for the first time CONCACAF champion." .

ns1:53861 a ns1:context_narration ;
