ns1:54054 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2009 Copa del Rey Final was the 107th final of the Spanish cup competition, the Copa del Rey (including two seasons where two rival editions were played). The final was played at Mestalla Stadium in Valencia on 2009. The match was won by FC Barcelona, who beat Athletic Club 4–1. The pre-match playing of the Spanish national anthem prompted widespread booing from Catalan nationalist fans of FC Barcelona and Basque nationalist fans of Athletic Club." .

