ns1:54096 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Unlike the previous three tournaments held in 2012, 2013 and 2014 Singapore League Cup, the League Cup Plate Competition between the third-placing teams in each group after the group stages were cancelled from 2015 onward. A total of 10 teams participated in the 2015 Singapore League Cup, eight S.League clubs and two National Football League clubs." .

