ns1:54255 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2002 Heineken Open was a tennis tournament played on outdoor hard courts at the ASB Tennis Centre in Auckland in New Zealand and was part of the International Series of the 2002 ATP Tour." .

ns1:54261 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2018 AFC Futsal Championship qualification is the 2016 AFC Futsal Championship qualification process organized by the Asian Football Confederation (AFC) to determine the participating teams for the 2018 AFC Futsal Championship, the 15th edition of the international men's futsal championship of Asia. The 2016 AFC Futsal Championship qualification process will be divided to four zones, where the ASEAN Zone doubled as the 2017 AFF Futsal Championship, the East Zone and West Zone will be played in Thailand, and the South Zone were merged to Central Zone after Nepal was the only team from South Zone." .

ns1:54264 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Operation Blowdown was an explosives test carried out in the Iron Range jungle of Australia's Cape York Peninsula in 1963, to simulate the effects of a nuclear weapon on tropical rainforest." .

ns1:54266 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The West End Classic was PGA Tour satellite event that was played at the Grand Bahama Hotel and Country Club in West End on Grand Bahama from 1967 to 1969." .

ns1:54278 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "MŽRKL League for the MŽRKL 2012–13 was the eleventh season of the MŽRKL. MŽRKL League for the MŽRKL 2012–13 has begun to play 26 September 2012 and ended on 23 February 2013, when he it was completed a Regular season. Cadet MŽRKL League comprises 11 teams, where each team plays each at once." .

ns1:54282 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 100%KPP World Tour was the debut world tour by Japanese singer Kyary Pamyu Pamyu." .

ns1:54283 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Milton Keynes Marathon is an annual marathon and marathon relay event held in Milton Keynes, England on the Spring bank holiday, first held in 2012. The start and finish of the event are based at the Stadium MK football stadium, home of Milton Keynes Dons F.C.. Much of the route of the marathon uses the Milton Keynes redway system through the parks and thus involves far less of the invariant-grade road running that is typical elsewhere." .

ns1:54284 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1924–25 Torquay United F.C. season was Torquay United F.C.'s fourth season in competitive football and their third season in the Southern League. Following on from their first two years in the Southern League, which had resulted in encouraging 6th and 1923–24 Torquay United F.C. season place finishes, Torquay United F.C.'s third season would prove to be something of a disappointment by comparison." .

ns1:54286 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2005 Medibank International was a tennis tournament played on outdoor hard courts. It was the 113th edition of the Sydney International, and part of the ATP World Tour 250 series of the 2005 ATP Tour, and of the WTA Premier tournaments of the 2005 WTA Tour. It was the 113th edition of the tournament and both the men's and the women's events took place at the NSW Tennis Centre in Sydney, Australia, from 9 to 2005." .

