ns1:54333 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2012 BYU Cougars football team represented Brigham Young University in the 2012 NCAA Division I FBS football season. 1 BYU Cougar was selected as a 2012 All-American participant, and 16 BYU Cougars were selected to the Phil-Steele All-Independent team to begin 2012 (Cody Hoffman was selected for two different positions)." .

