    rdfs:label "battle of the bands is a music music competition and music competition in which two or more bands compete for the title of \"best band\". A battle of the bands is a music competition in which many bands, usually rock or metal bands, but often musical acts from a range of different styles, compete for the title of \"best band\". Also in the United Kingdom, the largest annual music music competition in a battle of the bands format is Live and Unsigned, which has been operating since 2007." .

