ns1:54714 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1997 Australian Formula Ford Championship was a CAMS sanctioned Australia motor racing title for drivers of Formula Ford racing cars. It was 28th national series to be held in Australia for Formula Fords and the fifth to be contested under the Australian Formula Ford Championship name. The championship, which was promoted as the Ford Motorsport / Slick 50 Australian Formula Ford Championship, was won by Western Australia Garth Tander, driving a Van Diemen RF95." .

ns1:54727 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1942 Copa del Generalísimo Final was the 40th final of the King's Cup. The final was played at Estadio Chamartín in madrid, on 1942, being won by CF Barcelona, who beat Athletic Club 4-3 after extra time." .

