ns1:54871 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The ABU Radio Song Festival 2014 was the second edition of the biennial ABU Radio Song Festival, organised by the Asia-Pacific Broadcasting Union (ABU). The festival took place on 23 May 2014 in the Sri Lankan city of Colombo. Colombo is the largest city and the commercial, industrial and cultural capital of Sri Lanka. Colombo is also the administrative capital of Western Province, Sri Lanka and the district capital of Colombo District. The ABU Radio Song Festival which took place on 23 May 2014 coincided with the Radio Asia 2014 event that took place between 2014–2014." .

