ns1:54932 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "United Nations Security Council Resolution 1636, adopted unanimously on 31 October 2005, after recalling resolutions 1373 (2001), 1566 (2004) and 1595 (2005), the Council insisted that the Syrian authorities fully co-operate with the inquiry of the United Nations International Independent Investigation Commission (UNIIIC) into the assassination of former Lebanese Prime Minister Rafic Hariri, not least by arresting the suspects identified by the commission in its final report." .

ns1:54936 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2005 Men's World Open Squash Championship is the men's edition of the World Squash Championships, which serves as the individual world championship for squash players. The event took place in Hong Kong from 29 November to 2005. Amr Shabana won his second World Squash Championships title, defeating David Palmer in the final." .

ns1:54939 a ns1:context_narration ;
