ns1:54984 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2008 Progressive Conservative Party of New Brunswick leadership election held a leadership election in 2008, following the resignation of Bernard Lord on December 13, 2006. At the party's annual general meeting in Fredericton on October 20, 2007 it was announced that the convention would be held in the fall of 2008, on 2008 it was announced that the vote would take place on 2008 - exactly 11 years after the previous leadership election for the party." .

