ns1:55981 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2016–17 Persian Gulf Pro League (formerly known as Iran Pro League) was the 34th season of Iran Pro League and 16th as Iran Pro League since its establishment in 2001. The season featured 13 teams from the 2015–16 Persian Gulf Pro League and three new teams promoted from the 2015–16 Azadegan League: Paykan as champions, Machine Sazi and Sanat Naft." .

ns1:55988 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2002 UEFA Cup Final was an association football match played on 2002, between Feyenoord of the Netherlands and Borussia Dortmund of Germany. It was the 31st UEFA Cup Final and was held in the De Kuip in Rotterdam, which is the home ground of Feyenoord. Both Feyenoord and Borussia Dortmund started off their European campaigns in the 2001–02 Champions League and entered the 2001–02 UEFA Cup in the third round, after finishing third in their respective Champions League groups. A huge party erupted both inside and outside De Kuip not only because of the title, but also because the final was held two days after Rotterdam's politician Pim Fortuyn was murdered." .

ns1:55993 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2018 National League 2, also known as the 2018 MPT Myanmar National League 2, is the 6th season of the MNL-2, the second division league for association football clubs since its founding in 2012. In 2018 National League 2, there is only seven will play for MNL-2 winner." .

