    rdfs:label "The athletics at the 1952 Summer Olympics – men's marathon was held on 27 July 1952 on a course running from the Helsinki Olympic Stadium to Korso, Helsinki Rural Municipality (now Vantaa) and back." .

ns1:56285 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Roštiljijada or Leskovac Grill Festival (Serbian Cyrillic: Роштиљијада / Serbian Latin: Roštiljijada; also Serbian Cyrillic: Роштиљада / Serbian Latin: Roštiljada) is a yearly grilled-meat barbecue-week festival organised at the beginning of September in Leskovac, Serbia. Many visitors from all over Serbia and many tourists from abroad come to Leskovac to enjoy a grill and entertainment." .

