    rdfs:label "The 1916 Cork Senior Hurling Championship was the 29th staging of the Cork Senior Hurling Championship since its establishment by the Cork County Board in 1887. On 1916, Midleton GAA won the championship following a 4-0 to 3-2 defeat of Shamrocks in the final." .

ns1:57095 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1954 NCAA Men's Cross Country Championships were the 16th annual cross country meet to determine the team and individual national champions of men's collegiate cross country running in the United States of America. Held on 1954, the meet was hosted by Michigan State College at the Forest Akers East Golf Course in East Lansing." .

