ns1:57521 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Czech Cup (Czech: Pohár FAČR), officially known as the MOL Cup for sponsorship reasons, is the major men's football cup competition in the Czech Republic. This competition was discontinued in 1993, after the dissolution of Czechoslovakia into two independent states (Czech Republic and Slovakia)." .

ns1:57525 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1988 Australian Rally Championship was a series of four rallying events held across Australia. The 21st Australian Rally Championship was held over four events across Australia, the season consisting of one event each for Tasmania, Western Australia, New South Wales and Australian Capital Territory." .

