ns1:57652 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2009–10 Lega Pro Prima Divisione season was the thirty-second association football league season of Italy Lega Pro Prima Divisione since its establishment in 1978, and the second since the renaming from Serie C to Lega Pro. It was divided into two phases: the sports season, played from 23 August 2009 to May 2010, and the playoff phase from May to 13 June 2010. It was the first time in Italy professional association football that a club was excluded from a league during the season for a corruption case." .

ns1:57655 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Iran national football team and Iran-South Korea football rivalry men's national association football teams are sporting rivals and have played against each other officially since 1958, totalling 28 matches as of January 2015, including seven World Cup qualifiers." .

