ns1:57774 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2013 Sarawak FA season was Sarawak Football Association's 1st season in the Malaysia Premier League, after relegated in 2012 Malaysia Super League. Sarawak Football Association was relegated by Pahang in Playoff Qualifying after the MSL reducing the teams competing in 2013 to 12 teams from 14 teams. For the 2013 Sarawak FA season Sarawak was promoted to 2014 Malaysia Super League after being 1st in the league and being invincible after securing 18 wins with 4 draws and being undefeated throughout the season. Source: 2013 Malaysia Premier League. Source: 2013 Malaysia Cup." .

ns1:57778 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Stoneridge Investment Partners v. Scientific-Atlanta, 552 U.S. 148 (2008), was a decision by the Supreme Court of the United States pertaining to the scope of liability of secondary actors, such as lawyers and accountants, for securities fraud under the Securities Exchange Act of 1934. In a 5-3 decision authored by Justice Anthony Kennedy, the Court held that \"aiders and abettors\" of fraud cannot be held secondarily liable under the private right of action authorized by §10(b) of the Exchange Act." .

ns1:57789 a ns1:context_narration ;
