ns1:57844 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2003–04 ABA season was the third season of the American Basketball Association, and the first season since the league took a year off in 2002 for reorganization. The regular season started in 01 November 2003 and the year ended with the championship game in 09 March 2004 featuring the Long Beach Jam and Kansas City Knights." .

ns1:57848 a ns1:context_narration ;
