ns1:60470 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "In Your House 8: Beware of Dog was the eighth In Your House professional wrestling pay-per-view (PPV) event produced by the World Wrestling Federation (WWF, now WWE), that originally took place on 26 May 1996, from the Florence Civic Center in Florence, South Carolina. The two matches televised from the 26 May 1996 event were shown again at the beginning of the rescheduled pay-per-view. The event began by re-airing the two matches shown on pay-per-view from 26 May 1996 (Mero/Helmsley and Bulldog/Michaels). The WWF earned $63,435 in ticket sales from the 26 May 1996 event with an attendance of 6,000." .

