ns1:60603 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Belgium in the Junior Eurovision Song Contest 2008 chose their Junior Eurovision Song Contest 2008 entry for 2008 through Junior Eurosong, a national final consisting of 10 songs split into two quarter-finals, a semi-final and a grand final. Junior Eurosong was the national final for Belgium in the Junior Eurovision Song Contest 2008 at the Junior Eurovision Song Contest 2008, organised by Belgian broadcaster Vlaamse Radio- en Televisieomroep (VRT). At Junior Eurovision Song Contest 2008, Belgium in the Junior Eurovision Song Contest 2008 performed in seventh position, before Bulgaria and after Georgia." .

ns1:60604 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Battle of Qingshanli was fought over six days in 28 October 1920 between the Imperial Japanese Army and Korean armed groups in a densely wooded region of eastern Manchuria called Qīngshānlǐ (Japanese: 青山里, Seizanri; Korean: 청산리, Cheongsanri)." .

ns1:60605 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Northern Premier League Division One South is an English football league that was founded in 1968. The Northern Premier League Division One South (NPL) was founded in 1968, as the northern equivalent of the Southern League, decades after the other two leagues at what is now the seventh tier of the English football league system, the Isthmian League and the Southern League. At that time they were the highest level non-League division below the English football league, the same level as the other league in Northern England, the Northern League." .

