ns1:59949 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "\"The Vale of Lost Women\" is a fantasy short story by American author Robert E. Howard, one of his original short stories about Conan the Barbarian, however not published during his lifetime." .

ns1:59954 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "A by-election was held for the South Australian House of Assembly seat of 1892 East Adelaide colonial by-election on 23 January 1892. The 1892 1892 East Adelaide colonial by-election by-election saw ULP candidate John McPherson win the seat." .

ns1:59957 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Strolling of the Heifers is an annual local food parade and festival hosted in Brattleboro, Vermont each year. The Strolling of the Heifers owns The River Garden, a building in downtown Brattleboro." .

ns1:59988 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1976 Bali earthquake occurred at 15:13 local time on 14 July 1976 with a surface wave magnitude of 6.5. A subsequent earthquake of 6.5 Ms  southeast of Karangasem Regency on 18 December 1979 caused 27 deaths on the island and displaced a similar number of people as the 1976 event." .

