ns1:60122 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "1981 Micronesian parliamentary election were held in the Federated States of Micronesia on 03 March 1981." .

ns1:60134 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Japanese intervention in Siberia of 1918–1922 was the dispatch of Japanese military forces to the Russian Maritime Provinces as part of a larger effort by western powers and Japan to support White Russian forces against the Bolshevik Red Army during the Russian Civil War. However, patronage of various White Movement leaders left Japan in a poor diplomatic position vis-à-vis the government of the Soviet Union, after the Red Army eventually emerged victorious from the Russian Civil War." .

