ns1:61954 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2016 IAAF Diamond League was the seventh season of the annual series of outdoor track and field meetings, organised by the World Athletics (IAAF). The following fourteen meetings are scheduled to be included in the 2016 season: Events not included in the Diamond League are marked in grey background. There were twelve world leads set at the opening meet of the season in Doha, as well as 4 meeting records at an event which has begun the Diamond League season each of the past 7 years. The best performance of the 2016 Bislett Games was by Dafne Schippers, whose run of 21.93 seconds in the women's 200 m was a Diamond League record, meet record and a world lead." .

ns1:61962 a ns1:context_narration ;
