ns1:61986 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2014 Norwegian Football Cup Final was the 109th final of the Norwegian Football Cup. It was played on 23 November 2014 at Ullevaal Stadion, in Oslo, Norway. In the final Odds BK lost 2-0 to Molde FK, securing Molde FK's second cup title in a row and the double for the 2014 season. This was Molde FK's 7th cup final, while Odds BK traveled to Ullevaal for the 21st time. In the recent years, the two clubs has received 13,000 of the 25,500 tickets to the final, but after the expansion of Ullevaal Stadion the two clubs received 15,250 of the 27,000 tickets to the final." .

ns1:62006 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2010 Queen's Club Championships (also known traditionally as the Queen's Club Championships) was a tennis tournament played on outdoor grass courts. It was the 108Th edition of the Queen's Club Championships and was part of the ATP World Tour 250 series of the 2010 ATP World Tour. It took place at the Queen's Club in London, United Kingdom, from 7 to 13 June 2010." .

ns1:62012 a ns1:context_narration ;
