ns1:62881 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2015 Cajon Pass wildfire was a wildfire that occurred in the Mojave Desert near the towns of Victorville and Hesperia, north of San Bernardino and south of Bakersfield, California. In response to the drone activity over active wildfires, San Bernardino County, the California State Legislature and the Congress of the United States have all proposed restrictions on privately owned drones. 3025) one week prior to the 2015 Cajon Pass wildfire which would make it a federal offense to fly a UAV in a manner that interferes with fire fighters in the vicinity of a wildfire on federal lands." .

