ns1:63222 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2007 Belgian federal election took place on Sunday 10 June 2007. The previous 2003 Belgian federal election had resulted in a coalition between the socialist parties SP.a/Spirit (Flemish) and the Parti Socialiste (Francophone), and the centrist liberal-democratic parties VLD/Vivant (Flemish) and MR (Francophone), with Guy Verhofstadt of the VLD to retaining his position of Prime Minister of Belgium until 2007." .

ns1:63246 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Tour de Pakistan is a cycle sport held in Pakistan roughly every two years over more than 1,648 kilometres (1,024 mi). The 15th Tour de Pakistan started on March 1, 2010 participated by cyclists from different teams of Pakistan and Afghanistan." .

