ns1:63590 a ns1:context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Victory Road was a professional wrestling pay-per-view (PPV) event produced by the Total Nonstop Action Wrestling (TNA) promotion that took place on July 13, 2008 at the Reliant Arena in Houston. Bob Kapur of the professional wrestling section of the Canadian Online Explorer rated the show a 7 out of 10, which was lower than the 8 out of 10 given to the Victory Road (2007) by Chris Sokol. TNA issued a press release in late-May 2008 revealing that Victory Road would be held at the Reliant Arena in Houston. Victory Road featured eight professional wrestling matches that involved different wrestlers from pre-existing scripted feuds and storylines." .

